<title>USA: Human Genome Sciences names Mayer CFO.</title>
<headline>Human Genome Sciences names Mayer CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Human Genome Sciences Inc said on Tuesday that Steven Mayer will join the company as senior vice president, chief financial officer, effective September 23.</p>
<p>It said Mayer was formerly CFO of GenVec Inc of Rockville, Md.</p>
<p>Company officials were unavailable to confirm whether Mayer replaces a former CFO or if it is a newly created post.</p>
</text>
